<title>USA: Atlanta Fed business index 5.8 in Sept vs 4.9 Aug.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed business index 5.8 in Sept vs 4.9 Aug.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its diffusion index of industry business activity rose to 5.8 in September from a revised 4.9 in August.</p>
<p>The production index rose to 19.2 in September from a revised 12.3 in the previous month.</p>
<p>					   September	August revised</p>
<p>Industry Business Index		5.8		    4.9</p>
<p>Production Index			19.2		   12.3</p>
<p>Prices Received			- 1.9		  - 2.4</p>
<p>Prices Paid				4.7		    9.9</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		    - 8.3		  -10.6</p>
<p>New Orders				10.3		    5.3</p>
<p>Shipments				 15.9		   14.1</p>
<p>Number of Employees		  - 6.5		  - 0.7</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods    - 4.2		  -15.4</p>
<p>Materials Inventories		  3.7		  - 9.1</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1562</p>
